    "expectations": "engine-generated. Every `expected` value in this file was produced by this repository's own JavaScript engine (scripts/generate-vectors.mjs) from the same code the tests replay. Replaying them proves internal consistency and locks behaviour for the Rust/wasm port; it proves nothing about accuracy. The cases whose expectation is externally anchored are in tests/, not here.",
    "externalAnchors": "tests/psychrometrics-ashrae.test.js (ASHRAE Fundamentals tables at standard pressure, 0-50 °C); tests/psychrometrics-cold-pressure.test.js (ASHRAE over-ice table values, the IAPWS R14-08(2011) sublimation equation, PsychroLib recorded reference values, an independent first-principles wet-bulb derivation, Buck (1981) and WMO/Sonntag enhancement factors); tests/psychrometrics-range.test.js (ASHRAE over-ice table values); tests/merkel-accuracy.test.js (independently written quadrature)."
  },
